     <div class=\"bf-card-icon bf-card-icon-3\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n            <polygon points=\"12,2 15,9 22,9 17,14 19,21 12,17 5,21 7,14 2,9 9,9\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bf-card-title-box\">\n          <svg class=\"bf-card-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"bf-card-title\">Clinically Proven</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"bf-card-desc\">Proven muscle training, backed by scientific urology research for safe, natural rehabilitation.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bf-card\">\n        <div class=\"bf-card-icon bf-card-icon-4\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n            <path d=\"M12 6c-3 0-5.5 2-5.5 4.5S9 15 12 15s5.5-2 5.5-4.5S15 6 12 6z\" fill=\"#f3e8ff\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M4 11c0-3 3-5 8-5s8 2 8 5-3 5-8 5-8-2-8-5z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bf-card-title-box\">\n          <svg class=\"bf-card-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/></svg>\n          <span class=\"bf-card-title\">A Long-Term Solution</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"bf-card-desc\">Strengthens the muscles that control bladder function, addressing the root cause instead of using temporary covers.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
