        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .cb-section { padding: 4rem 1rem; background: #fcfbf7; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-section { padding: 6rem 1rem; } }\n  .cb-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6rem; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-inner { gap: 8rem; } }\n  .cb-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-row { grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr; } }\n  .cb-row-reverse { direction: ltr; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-row-reverse { direction: rtl; } .cb-row-reverse > * { direction: ltr; } }\n  .cb-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }\n  .cb-heading { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-heading { font-size: 2.25rem; } }\n  .cb-text { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #374151; margin: 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-text { font-size: 1.125rem; } }\n  .cb-text strong { color: #111827; font-weight: 700; }\n  .cb-text .highlight { color: #e27243; font-weight: 700; }\n  .cb-underline { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }\n  .cb-accent { color: #3bd9ca; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-thickness: 4px; }\n  .cb-image-box { display: flex; justify-content: center; }\n  .cb-image-mock { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden; border: 4px solid #fff; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f3f4f6, #e5e7eb); padding: 1.5rem; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }\n  .cb-image-mock-alt { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0fdf4, #dbeafe); }\n  .cb-image-badge { position: absolute; bottom: 16px; right: 16px; color: #fff; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; z-index: 20; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .cb-image-badge-red { background: #dc2626; }\n  .cb-image-badge-red-light { background: #fecaca; color: #991b1b; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; }\n  .cb-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #3bd9ca; color: #000; font-weight: 800; padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 12px; border-bottom: 4px solid #259b90; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1rem; transition: all 0.3s; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb-cta { font-size: 1.125rem; } }\n  .cb-cta:hover { background: #2bc4b5; transform: translateY(-1px); }\n  .cb-cta-arrow { width: 20px; height: 20px; margin-left: 10px; animation: cb-pulse 2s infinite; }\n  @keyframes cb-pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.5; } }\n  .cb-italic { font-style: italic; color: #6b7280; }\n  .cb-strong-red { color: #dc2626; font-weight: 700; }\n  .cb-strong-emerald { color: #047857; font-weight: 700; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"cb-section\">\n  <div class=\"cb-inner\">\n    <div class=\"cb-row\">\n      <div class=\"cb-content\">\n        <h2 class=\"cb-heading\">You're Not Too Old to Fix This&mdash;And Here's Why</h2>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\"><strong>Many men believe that once bladder leaks start, there's no way to reverse them.</strong> But that's simply not true.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">Your pelvic floor is a muscle&mdash;and like any muscle, <strong>it can be strengthened at any age.</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">Studies show that <strong>men in their 40s to 90s</strong> can regain bladder control by activating and strengthening these muscles properly.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text cb-underline\">And just like any muscle, if you don't strengthen it, it will continue to weaken.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">Most men struggle to perform pelvic floor exercises correctly. They squeeze the wrong muscles, forget to stay consistent, and then give up when they don't see results.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">No matter how much effort you put in, if your pelvic floor remains weak, <strong>leaks will keep happening.</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text cb-italic\">And the longer you wait...</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">...the harder it becomes to rebuild lost strength and take back control.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\" style=\"font-size:1.125rem;\">The good news? <strong class=\"highlight\">It's not too late to stop the cycle.</strong></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cb-image-box\">\n        <div class=\"cb-image-mock\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.15;background-image:radial-gradient(#4a5568 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:12px 12px;\"></div>\n          <div class=\"cb-image-badge cb-image-badge-red\" style=\"top:16px;right:16px;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;border:2px solid #fff;padding:0;\">&#10005;</div>\n          <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:10;margin-top:auto;margin-left:1rem;width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:50%;background:#fef7ed;border:4px solid #ef4444;box-shadow:0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"width:72px;height:72px;\">\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#c2410c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path d=\"M5 20c0-4 3-5 7-5s7 1 7 5\" fill=\"#ea580c\" stroke=\"#9a3412\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path d=\"M8 7c-.5 0-.8.5-.8 1s.3 1.5.8 1.5M16 7c.5 0 .8.5 .8 1s-.3 1.5-.8 1.5\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cb-image-badge cb-image-badge-red-light\">Uncontrolled Leaks</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cb-row cb-row-reverse\">\n      <div class=\"cb-content\">\n        <h2 class=\"cb-heading\">Introducing: The <span class=\"cb-accent\">PelviDex&trade;</span> Pelvic Floor Trainer</h2>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">The PelviDex&trade; helps men over 60 regain bladder control by <strong>guiding pelvic floor contractions with real-time biofeedback.</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">It uses <strong>pressure-sensing technology</strong> to detect and strengthen the muscle responsible for leaks and urgency.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">This helps <strong>reduce accidents,</strong> improve control, and restore confidence over time.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">It enhances your <strong>mind-muscle connection,</strong> making pelvic floor training simple, visual, and effective &mdash; no guesswork.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">The app-based system includes <strong>interactive games and structured programs,</strong> designed to keep you engaged and improving every week.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\">The PelviDex&trade; fits all body types, works with any chair, and requires <strong>no invasive procedures and no clinic visits.</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"cb-text\" style=\"font-size:1.125rem;\">With just <strong class=\"highlight\">5-10 minutes a day,</strong> most men start noticing results in as little as <strong class=\"highlight\">4&ndash;6 weeks.</strong></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cb-image-box\">\n        <div class=\"cb-image-mock cb-image-mock-alt\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.1;background-image:radial-gradient(#b45309 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:20px 20px;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:10;width:100%;height:180px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:0.5rem;\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"width:144px;height:144px;\">\n              <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"22\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"22\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M8 2h8v11H8V2z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"13\"/>\n              <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"13\"/>\n              <rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#475569\" stroke=\"#1e293b\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:1rem;right:1rem;background:#fff;border:2px solid #10b981;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;z-index:20;box-shadow:0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"width:40px;height:40px;\">\n              <ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div style=\"font-size:10px;line-height:1.3;\">\n              <span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1f2937;display:block;\">Target Active</span>\n              <span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:600;\">Pelvic Floor Zone</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
