        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .cb3-section { padding: 4rem 1rem; background: #fcfbf7; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb3-section { padding: 6rem 1rem; } }\n  .cb3-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6rem; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb3-inner { gap: 8rem; } }\n  .cb3-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb3-row { grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr; } }\n  .cb3-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }\n  .cb3-heading { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb3-heading { font-size: 2.25rem; } }\n  .cb3-text { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #374151; margin: 0; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb3-text { font-size: 1.125rem; } }\n  .cb3-text strong { color: #111827; font-weight: 700; }\n  .cb3-feature-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; }\n  .cb3-feature-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .cb3-feature-body h4 { font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1rem; }\n  .cb3-feature-body p { color: #6b7280; margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; }\n  @media (min-width: 768px) { .cb3-feature-body p { font-size: 1rem; } }\n  .cb3-callout { background: #fef08a; color: #111827; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; }\n  .cb3-note { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic; }\n  .cb3-image-box { display: flex; justify-content: center; }\n  .cb3-image-mock { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 1rem; overflow: hidden; border: 4px solid #fff; padding: 1.5rem; position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); }\n  .cb3-image-mock-bio { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0f9ff, #fff, #e0f2fe); }\n  .cb3-image-mock-shield { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ecfdf5, #ccfbf1); }\n  .cb3-image-badge { position: absolute; bottom: 1rem; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .cb3-image-badge-teal { background: #3bd9ca; color: #000; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n  .cb3-image-badge-emerald { background: #065f46; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"cb3-section\">\n  <div class=\"cb3-inner\">\n    <div class=\"cb3-row\">\n      <div class=\"cb3-content\">\n        <h2 class=\"cb3-heading\">How The PelviDex&trade; Works</h2>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\">The PelviDex&trade; is the only pelvic floor trainer for men that combines <strong>real-time biofeedback</strong> with <strong>precision pressure guidance</strong>.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;\">\n          <div class=\"cb3-feature-item\">\n            <span class=\"cb3-feature-icon\">&#x1F9E0;</span>\n            <div class=\"cb3-feature-body\">\n              <h4>Biofeedback Technology</h4>\n              <p>Tracks your pelvic muscle contractions as you squeeze and relax. This gives you <strong>instant feedback</strong> so you know you're training the right muscles.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cb3-feature-item\">\n            <span class=\"cb3-feature-icon\">&#x1F4F1;</span>\n            <div class=\"cb3-feature-body\">\n              <h4>App-Guided Sessions</h4>\n              <p>The connected <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">free app</span> adjusts difficulty based on your performance, leveling up as you improve. It personalizes your routine over time, helping you <strong>build strength, endurance, and control</strong>.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cb3-callout\">Think of it like a personal trainer for your pelvic floor.</div>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\">It ensures you're <strong>engaging the right muscles</strong>, so you can do Kegels correctly. The <strong>free app</strong> includes a selection of expertly designed training programs created by pelvic health specialists to guide you through effective sessions.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb3-note\">One charge can last 2 weeks when used 2-3 times per day.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cb3-image-box\">\n        <div class=\"cb3-image-mock cb3-image-mock-bio\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\" style=\"width:180px;height:180px;\">\n            <path d=\"M12 4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4z\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            <path d=\"M6 14c0-2 2-3 6-3s6 1 6 3v5H6v-5z\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n            <ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"15.5\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"2.5\" fill=\"#fef08a\" stroke=\"#eab308\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n            <ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"15.5\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"1.5\" fill=\"#3bd9ca\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M4 14.5c2-1 4-1 6 0M14 14.5c2-1 4-1 6 0\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div class=\"cb3-image-badge cb3-image-badge-teal\">Active Biofeedback Loop</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cb3-row\">\n      <div class=\"cb3-content\">\n        <h2 class=\"cb3-heading\">Try It for 90 Days, 100% Risk-Free</h2>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\">Here's the deal: we believe in this product so much that we <strong>don't want you to spend a dime until you are 100% certain that it works for you.</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\">That's why we are offering a <strong>90-day &ldquo;Results or Refund&rdquo; Guarantee.</strong></p>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\">Simply, get yourself The PelviDex&trade; today, use it for 90 days, and then make your decision based on the results.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;text-decoration-thickness:2px;font-weight:700;\">If you are not absolutely thrilled with the results, we will issue you an immediate refund.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb3-text\">In other words, you are only paying if it turns out to be a complete lifesaver.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cb3-image-box\">\n        <div class=\"cb3-image-mock cb3-image-mock-shield\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1\" style=\"width:180px;height:180px;\">\n            <path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3bd9ca\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n            <path d=\"M9 11l2 2 4-4\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div class=\"cb3-image-badge cb3-image-badge-emerald\">No Questions Asked Refund</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
